task.action:
- Create new capability file with .capability.ts suffix
- Define GlobalActionsGroupItem class extending vscode.TreeItem:
  - Label: "Global Actions"
  - CollapsibleState: Expanded (default)
  - ThemeIcon: "tools" (represents utilities/actions)
  - contextValue: "globalActionsGroup"
- Define GlobalActionItem class extending vscode.TreeItem:
  - Constructor params: label, iconName, command
  - CollapsibleState: None
  - ThemeIcon: from iconName param ("book" or "symbol-structure")
  - command: { command: "kanban.runGlobalAction", arguments: [{ command }] }
  - contextValue: "globalAction"
- Create createGlobalActionsViewCapability factory function:
  - Returns { createTreeDataProvider, createRefreshCallback }
  - TreeDataProvider.getChildren(): returns GlobalActionsGroupItem at root
  - GlobalActionsGroupItem returns two GlobalActionItem children:
    1. "Map Product Docs" with icon "book" and command "/kanban-map-product"
    2. "Map Engineering Docs" with icon "symbol-structure" and command "/kanban-map-engineering"
- Export factory function with explicit return type

Approximate code structure:
```typescript
class GlobalActionsGroupItem extends vscode.TreeItem {
  constructor() {
    super('Global Actions', vscode.TreeItemCollapsibleState.Expanded);
    this.iconPath = new vscode.ThemeIcon('tools');
    this.contextValue = 'globalActionsGroup';
  }
}

class GlobalActionItem extends vscode.TreeItem {
  constructor(label: string, iconName: string, public readonly actionCommand: string) {
    super(label, vscode.TreeItemCollapsibleState.None);
    this.iconPath = new vscode.ThemeIcon(iconName);
    this.command = {
      command: 'kanban.runGlobalAction',
      title: label,
      arguments: [{ command: actionCommand }],
    };
    this.contextValue = 'globalAction';
  }
}

export function createGlobalActionsViewCapability(): CreateGlobalActionsViewCapabilityReturn {
  // Factory pattern matching config-view.capability.ts
}
```

- Add new view to contributes.views.kanban array
- Position after kanbanConfig (index 2) so it appears below Config
- View ID: "kanbanGlobalActions"
- View name: "Global Actions"

Current code (lines 36-45):
```json
"views": {
  "kanban": [
    { "id": "kanbanTasks", "name": "Tasks" },
    { "id": "kanbanConfig", "name": "Config" }
  ]
}
```

Change to:
```json
"views": {
  "kanban": [
    { "id": "kanbanTasks", "name": "Tasks" },
    { "id": "kanbanConfig", "name": "Config" },
    { "id": "kanbanGlobalActions", "name": "Global Actions" }
  ]
}
```

1. Import the capability (after line 21):
   ```typescript
   import { createGlobalActionsViewCapability } from './capabilities/global-actions-view.capability';
   ```

2. Initialize capability (after configView initialization, around line 180):
   ```typescript
   // Initialize global actions view capability
   const globalActionsView = createGlobalActionsViewCapability();
   ```

3. Create provider (after configTreeDataProvider, around line 190):
   ```typescript
   const globalActionsTreeDataProvider = globalActionsView.createTreeDataProvider();
   ```

4. Register TreeView (after configTreeView registration, around line 208):
   ```typescript
   // Register Global Actions TreeView
   const globalActionsTreeView = vscode.window.createTreeView('kanbanGlobalActions', {
     treeDataProvider: globalActionsTreeDataProvider,
   });
   context.subscriptions.push(globalActionsTreeView);
   ```

5. Register runGlobalAction command (after runAction command, around line 254):
   ```typescript
   // Run global action command (policy: when to run global actions)
   context.subscriptions.push(
     vscode.commands.registerCommand(
       'kanban.runGlobalAction',
       (args: { command: string }) => {
         if (!args?.command) {
           vscode.window.showErrorMessage('Invalid global action arguments');
           return;
         }

         const kanbanTerminal = terminal.createFreshTerminal('Kanban', workspaceRoot);
         terminal.showTerminal(kanbanTerminal);
         terminal.sendCommand(kanbanTerminal, `claude "${args.command}"`);
       }
     )
   );
   ```
